          "rationale": "The phrase their modeled category content and recovery predictions attributes recovery predictions to those command entries. The supplied command table contains only category fields and no recovery_by_delay; recovery is supplied under predicted_current. The attribution is unsupported. It is separated from the valid general fact that recovery cannot establish physical truth or correctness."
